1. Project Task: Core Flows and Tenancy
Your task has three main requirements:
Every Prisma database model must have an organisationId field.
Every database query must be restricted to the logged-in user's organisation.
An automated test must prove that Organisation A cannot access Organisation B's ticket.
Example
Suppose there are two organisations:
Organisation
